const meet=`<section class="meet" aria-labelledby="meet-h"><picture class="meet-art"><source type="image/webp" srcset="/art/vo-ferro-sheet.webp"><img src="/art/vo-ferro-sheet.jpg" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Vó Ferro character sheet: front, three-quarter, side and back views plus three expressions"></picture><div class="meet-copy"><h2 id="meet-h">Meet Vó Ferro</h2><p><b>Dona Ferreira, "Vó Ferro" (Grandma Iron)</b>, is a 72-year-old retired seamstress from Recife. After her second knee surgery a doctor told her to rest for the rest of her life. She went to the free outdoor gym in her praça instead, and kept going: from dead hangs to her first human flag at 71.</p><p>Now she demonstrates every one of the ${M.length} moves in this library and grades each one from Rookie to Legend. Warm, funny and merciless.</p><blockquote class="bubble">"Meu filho, that's not a rep, that's a suggestion. Again. Slower."</blockquote></div></section>`;
