<section class="box"><h2>Benchmarks by tier (one all-out set)</h2><div style="overflow-x:auto"><table><tr><th>Test</th>${TI.map((t,i)=>`<th><a href="/levels/${t.toLowerCase()}/" style="color:${TC[i]}">${t}</a></th>`).join('')}</tr>${SD.map(([s,n,u,v])=>`<tr><th><a href="/m/${s}/">${esc(n)}</a> <small>(${u})</small></th>${v.map(x=>`<td>${esc(x)}</td>`).join('')}</tr>`).join('')}</table></div><p><small>These are Calisthenics Comics house benchmarks that line up with our 1–10 move levels, not an official or scientific norm. Count strict, full-range reps only.</small></p></section>
