<section class="box"><h2>How to test</h2><p>Warm up for 5–10 minutes, then do one all-out set per test with clean form. Rest at least 3 minutes between tests and stop a set as soon as form breaks. Write your scores down and retest every 4–6 weeks. Not sure where to begin? <a href="/start/">Read the beginner guide</a>, then follow a <a href="/w/">workout plan</a> for your tier.</p></section>
